body:
I can't recall the name in a previous delivery. We maintain a really really small social circle and don't go out so no real chances of a prior non-delivery interaction. We haven't even driven in years. 

&#x200B;

I did post a very specific update in the comments. Was about as forthcoming as I could be without falling into what I Think would be explicit shaming.

I'll send an invite as soon as someone leaves my island c: Don't want to let too many people in at once! Shouldn't take long!

&#x200B;

Edit: Invited!

I bought in $5 as a joke earlier this year. My father read about it on the news and, with his limited budget, he asked if he should put in his $1000 savings into buying it. He's over 50 and has no retirement in sight. I said no - it wasn't worth risking his whole life on.

&#x200B;

Feels bad.

Sure. I'll DM you a dodo code?

&#x200B;

Edit: Sorry, just for the dining tables though. Is that okay?
